      "width": 320,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### S00.01-00-00 Bootloader\nHow to process kit files. Load order, precedence.\n\n### S00.00-00-00 Readme\nKit naming and precedence rules."
    },
    {
      "id": "tk-export-sort",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -400,
      "y": -100,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### Export & Sorting\n- **S00.01-01-00** Export Rules\n- **S00.01-01-10** Topic Segmentation\n- **S00.01-01-20** Sorting & Placement Protocol"
    },
    {
      "id": "tk-schema",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -400,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### Schema & Format\n- **S00.01-02-00** Frontmatter Schema\n- **S00.01-02-10** Time Rules\n- **S00.01-02-20** Spelling Rules"
    },
    {
